# Walk back through the base to the bureau circuit-breaker. `Porte21` is the electrical-box
# door covering the fuse socket: `use Porte21` runs its own `XIIIPorte.PlayerTriggerToggle`
# (open) and clears the box mesh from the sight line. `track XIIIGoalTrigger19` then points the
# view at the exposed socket, so the game's own `XIIIPlayerController.ReturnTrace` picks the
# trigger (measured: door closed -> TargetActor Porte21; door open + aim -> XIIIGoalTrigger19,
# `bCanTrigger=true`). The carried fuse (`EventItem.UseMe`) then triggers the goal (goal 3).
# `item90` implemented Core.dll `execArrayElement`'s out-of-range fixed-array clamp, so
# `Hual04a.SetGoalComplete` case 3 no longer errors. Waypoints are the item86 fuse-leg trace.
t=378.00 goto -4077.2 1836.9
